on 'user-mongodb:27017']\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:53.785294] <error>: (UserService.cpp:80:main) Failed to create mongodb index, try again\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:55.085158] <error>: (utils_mongodb.h:76:CreateIndex) Error in createIndexes: No suitable servers found: `serverSelectionTimeoutMS` expired: [connection refused calling ismaster on 'user-mongodb:27017']\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:55.085313] <error>: (UserService.cpp:80:main) Failed to create mongodb index, try again\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:56.385163] <error>: (utils_mongodb.h:76:CreateIndex) Error in createIndexes: No suitable servers found: `serverSelectionTimeoutMS` expired: [unknown connection error calling ismaster on 'user-mongodb:27017']\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:56.385301] <error>: (UserService.cpp:80:main) Failed to create mongodb index, try again\n[2026-Mar-17 21:52:59.192677] <info>: (UserService.cpp:94:main) Starting the user-service server ...\n", id='25019641-21bb-4079-9426-a0e8afe40491', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-be72023842819deb'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='836ec269-d401-44e7-aad7-86fc5c219188')]]
