kpoint snapshot min: 51, snapshot max: 51 snapshot count: 0, oldest timestamp: (0, 0) , meta checkpoint timestamp: (0, 0)"}}\n', id='29720afb-8ee2-4a4f-bdd9-25354ce01823', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-86a5d438bdb77e60'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='b05a6d57-c154-421a-a183-9285e4abfd16')]]
